# Cloudflare _redirects
# Legacy multi-route paths -> single-page anchors.
#
# These replace next.config `redirects()`, which Next DROPS under
# output: "export".
#
# Fragments in the DESTINATION are supported by Cloudflare and are sent to the
# browser, which then scrolls to the section. Fragments in the SOURCE are never
# seen by Cloudflare, so they cannot be matched.
#
# Both trailing-slash variants are listed: /about and /about/ are distinct
# sources to Cloudflare, and a bookmark may carry either.

/about    /#about    308
/about/   /#about    308
/resume   /#resume   308
/resume/  /#resume   308
/contact  /#contact  308
/contact/ /#contact  308